# Secrets never enter the build context.
plow-credentials
plow-credentials.*
!plow-credentials.example

.git
tests
# Rooted patterns only match the context root, and every one of these lives
# nested: the bytecode under skills/*/scripts/ shipped inside the image for
# months because `__pycache__` alone never reached it.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
**/.DS_Store
# Agent Index artwork: the avatar and the carousel. Nothing COPYs it, so it
# only ever cost upload time on every build.
assets/
README.md
AGENTS.md
# The odds edge is deployed to Cloudflare, not shipped inside the agent. The
# agent only ever calls its URL.
edge/
